"If you experience installation problems consider trying official mirrors "
"only.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue, using this/these mirror(s)?"
msgstr ""
"Si experimentas problemas de instalación, considera usar únicamente "
"servidores espejo oficiales.\n"
"\n"
"¿Deseas continuar usando este/estos servidores espejo?"

